ys or tools can be hidden.<br></li><li> <strong>Different levels of difficulty</strong> — There are different levels of difficulty that change the speed of movement of the fisherman.<br></li><li> <strong>He can hear you</strong> — Not only the sounds you make inside the game, but also your microphone is part of the game. However, the microphone can be turned off if you like.<br></li><li> <strong>VR-Mode</strong> — Play Fisherman's House like never before! Use your favorite VR headset for a whole new experience.</li></ul><br><i>Have fun and enjoy exploring!</i>", "short_description": "You have been kidnapped, and you don't know why and where you are. All you know is that you have to escape from this place before the fisherman kills you. In this house, you will find some items and puzzles that will help you escape from this house. Will you survive or get killed by the fisherman?", "supported_languages": "English, German, Russian", "header_image": "https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1745000/header.jpg?t=1785961421", "capsule_image": "https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1745000/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1785961421", "capsule_imagev5": "https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1745000/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1785961421", "website": "https://frosthain.com/", "pc_requirements": {"minimum": "<strong>Minimum:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li>Requires a 64-bit processor and operating system<br></li><li><strong>OS:</strong> Windows 10 (64Bit)<br></li><li><strong>Processor:</strong> AMD Ryzen 5 3600, Core i5 6600K<br></li><li><strong>Memory:</strong> 4 GB RAM<br></li><li><strong>Graphics:</strong> NVIDIA GeForce GTX 730<br></li><li><strong>DirectX:</strong> Version 11<br></li><li><strong>Storage:</strong> 4 GB available space<br></li><li><strong>VR Support:</strong> SteamVR. Standing Only</li></ul>", "recommended": "<strong>Recommended:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li>Requires a 64-bit proce